<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35092" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδάκνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bite into, seize with the teeth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχιδνα δ᾽ ὥς μέ τις πόδ᾽ ἐνδακοῦσ᾽
					ἔχει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					897
				</span></i>
			 (dub.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. στόμια γνάθοις</span>
			<i>take</i> the bit <i>between the teeth</i>, of runaway horses,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1223
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. Χαλινόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					254d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ Χεῖλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cal.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., of
			sharp things, <i>fix themselves firm in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ γῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					<u>Poliorc.</u>
					145.9
				</span></i>
			; of mustard, <i>to be pungent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				70.16
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
